          "variant": "prose",
          "heading": "How we started",
          "html": "<p><em>Sample text — replace me:</em> Most of us learned from a mother, a shop class, or a longarm we bought on a whim. Mixed guilds are fine. This one exists because some of us sew more when the room is mostly men, the talk is about tension and grain, and nobody asks whether the quilt is for a wife.</p>",
